--TEST--
`prepareRename` on the html text of an html template is refused, because the text outside its holes is no symbol
--FILE--
<?nvs
string $name = "Ada";
echo html`<p>Hel<|>lo {$name}</p>`;
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
